sistance, love and transformation in the present tense.&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/a-house-of-dynamite\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">A House of Dynamite</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">12:30 PM</div><div class=\"time-slot\">6:20 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/11955.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">An unattributed nuclear missile is launched at the US, igniting a chain response to identify the responsible party and to decide on how the nation will respond, in Kathryn Bigelow's latest.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/one-battle-after-another\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">One Battle After Another</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">12:45 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/11848.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Sixteen years after the defeat of their great enemy, a group of former revolutionaries must reunite when he resurfaces, to save one of their own’s daughter, in Paul Thomas Anderson's loose adaption from Thomas Pynchon's <i>Vineland</i>.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/lff-cover-up\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">BFI London Film Festival 2025</div><div class=\"title \">Cover-Up</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">3:25 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/11806.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Acclaimed documentary directors Mark Obenhaus and Laura Poitras team up to deliver an engrossing portrait of investigative journalist Seymour M. Hersh.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/the-smashing-machine\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">The Smashing Machine</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">4:00 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/11954.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Dwayne Johnson plays legendary mixed martial arts fighter Mark Kerr, whose meteoric rise is haunted by addiction and personal strife in Benny Safdie's knock out sports biopic.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/lff-hotel-london\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">BFI London Film Festival 2025</div><div class=\"title \">Hotel London</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">6:10 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/11807.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">A Bangladeshi family confronts the harsh realities of temporary unstable housing in London, in a newly remastered drama that blends fiction with video activism.</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/perfect-blue-4k-restoration\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title \">Perfect Blue (4K Restoration)</div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:30 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/11850.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">After leaving her pop idol group and starting a new life as an actress, Mima soon finds herself overwhelmed by a wave of provocative roles that go against her wishes. Before long, a string of murders begins to unfold, targeting those around her…</div>\n\t\t    </a></div><div class=\"item films \"><div class=\"subhead sans films\">\n                                              <a href=\"/films\">Films</a>\n                                          </div><a href=\"/films/lff-shadows-of-the-living\"><div class=\"item-info float-container\"><div class=\"title-container\"><div class=\"title season-item\">BFI London Film Festival 2025</div><div class=\"title \">Shadows of The Living </div></div><div class=\"time-container time films\"><div class=\"time-slot\">8:40 PM</div></div></div><div class='img-container img-container-thumb'><img alt=\"\" src=\"//www.ica.art/media/11870.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>                <div class=\"description sans\">Here, human and more‑than‑human lives intermingle in peculiar 